<title>JAPAN: MOTORCYCLING-JAPANESE GRAND PRIX 500CC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-JAPANESE GRAND PRIX 500CC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SUZUKA, Japan 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Japanese</p>
<p>Grand Prix 500cc category on Sunday:</p>
<p>Race distance: 21 laps, 123.144 km</p>
<p>1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda 45 minutes 11.995 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Alex Criville (Spain) Honda	   45:12.426</p>
<p>  3. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda	  45:18.042</p>
<p>  4. Takuma Aoki (Japan) Honda	     45:35.614</p>
<p>  5. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda	   45:35.890</p>
<p>  6. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda	    45:36.397</p>
<p>  7. Norifumi Abe (Japan) Yamaha	   45:36.710</p>
<p>  8. Alberto Puig (Spain) Honda	    45:55.908</p>
<p>  9. Norihiko Fujiwara (Japan) Yamaha    45:55.998</p>
<p> 10. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda	    46:10.866</p>
